<body>

        <%- include('templates/navBar.ejs'); -%>

    <div class="wrapper">

        <div class="head">
            <h2 id="title">Crafted With Passion</h2>
            <p id="description">We believe great food is not just cooked, It's cooked with care, culture and consistency </p>
        </div>

        <div class="story">
            <div class="story-info">
                <h2 id="title">Our Story</h2>
                <p id="description">This place started with hunger, curiosity, and a refusal to settle 
                    for forgettable food. We cook with real ingredients, a lot of patience, and just enough stubbornness to get things right. Our menu blends familiar flavors with small surprises, made for sharing stories, not just     meals. Come hungry. Leave happy. That's the whole idea.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="image">
                <img src="https://plus.unsplash.com/premium_photo-1670984935550-5ce2e220977a?q=80&w=1170&auto=format&fit=crop&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D" width="400" height="300" alt="Restaurant Photo"> 
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-class">
                <h2 id="title">Quality Ingredients</h2>
                <p id="description">Fresh, carefully sourced, and treated with respect. No shortcuts, no sad produce.</p>
            </div>
             <div class="feature-class">
                <h2 id="title">Made From Scratch</h2>
                <p id="description">Sauces, sides, and mains cooked the long way, because flavor takes effort.</p>
            </div>
             <div class="feature-class">
                <h2 id="title">Warm Atmosphere</h2>
                <p id="description">Comfortable, welcoming, and free of unnecessary attitude.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
